 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Earth Manipulation — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you gain access to new ways to manipulate the earth around yourself.<br />\n<strong>Rock Blast.</strong> As an action, you can spend 1 CE to imbue your cursed energy into a rock and launch it at a target within 30 feet. You can use your CE modifier or Strength modifier for the attack and damage roll. On a hit, you deal 1d12 bludgeoning damage (you can spend 1 additional CE to instead deal necrotic damage). If you have the extra attack feature, you can replace one of your attacks this way.<br />\n<strong>Earthen Armor.</strong> As a bonus action, you can spend CE up to your proficiency bonus to protect yourself with earth. For 1 minute, you gain a bonus to your AC equal to the cursed energy spent.<br />\n<strong>Tremor.</strong> As an action, you can spend 3 cursed energy to strike the ground. Creatures in a 20-foot radius around yourself must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 3d10 bludgeoning damage and are knocked prone. On a success, they take half as much damage and are not prone. Structures automatically fail and take maximum damage. This increases to 4d10 at 6th level, 5d10 at 11th level, and 6d10 at 18th level.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
